---
<section class="bg-warm-white px-6 py-28 md:py-32">
  <div class="fade-in-up mx-auto max-w-[1040px]">
    <div class="text-center">
      <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">
        The Difference
      </p>
      <h2
        class="mx-auto max-w-3xl font-serif font-normal leading-tight"
        style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;"
      >
        Dating apps optimize for engagement.
        <span class="text-gold">We optimize for actual connection.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.8;">
        We bring together thoughtful, high-agency people who want a richer social life and a better chance of meeting the right person in it.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-soft-black" style="line-height: 1.8;">
        Through curated gatherings, intentional introductions, and a trusted member network, we create the kind of context where relationships can actually begin.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl font-serif text-lg italic text-muted" style="line-height: 1.8;">
        Dating apps give you volume. Social scenes give you chaos. We give you context.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-white px-6 py-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Better rooms</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-muted" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          Small, well-composed gatherings where people can actually talk, observe, and connect.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-white px-6 py-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Better signals</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-muted" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          Shared context, clearer intentions, and more information than a profile ever gives you.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-divider bg-white px-6 py-6">
        <p class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Better follow-through</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-muted" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          A trusted club structure that rewards presence, reputation, and showing up well.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
